    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 214,
        "text": "Okay, everyone, thanks for coming. The city wants our community panel to judge how reliable the new environmental forecasts are. Let's start with the river-level model. Priya, you tested it last month, right?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "08f15948ad3787460a0caa57c511963caab96c1c2fc909c5004895c4717cd382",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 222,
        "sourceEnd": 477,
        "text": "Yes. I compared its predictions with the actual gauge readings for thirty days. On most days it was close, but on two days it was off by more than half a meter. If the model had used the newer rainfall data, those two days would probably have been better.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "839bc99171cc8551024203f0327da049d9653cadb364ba4acaa675f8739675e7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 484,
        "sourceEnd": 536,
        "text": "Good point. So what do you suggest we tell the city?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "76a5668489578416ed811e2a5ad803237f6cc11495b5ef6836e71290f64f965b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 544,
        "sourceEnd": 677,
        "text": "I suggest we ask them to update the rainfall input before the spring floods. If they update it now, the forecasts will be much safer.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "e29b958926568f4cbecee082c034ce32d8a9621ed61ad7be1cd4aa601c7b4cbe",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 683,
        "sourceEnd": 905,
        "text": "Can I add something? I looked at the air-quality forecast. It was reliable for the city center, but it missed a pollution spike near the industrial park. If we add one more sensor there, we will catch those spikes earlier.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "00680bde1a262a35d30395cfc528f2e68490bda3d3601e64b676aa9868d32ca7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 912,
        "sourceEnd": 1030,
        "text": "That sounds practical. But we should also think about cost. Daniel, you spoke to the budget office. What did they say?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "df14875e2f69300991dc52c2f0b9e155e066c650ad43272a2635b5f448896617",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 1039,
        "sourceEnd": 1202,
        "text": "They said they can fund one new sensor this year, not two. So we have to choose. I'd recommend the industrial-park sensor, because the health risk there is higher.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "309e2dc9d45833c2c1c7c2be6967fc6a45549fce9e10fa892339d88cdfb60596",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1209,
        "sourceEnd": 1268,
        "text": "Okay. Now, the heat-wave alert system. Elena, any problems?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "de47e79a538de4f787457b28b0f8019dffa10b1b900ce1dd85ca17c7a72735df",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "elena",
        "speaker": "Elena",
        "sourceStart": 1276,
        "sourceEnd": 1488,
        "text": "Actually, yes. The alerts arrived on time, but the language was too technical. Many older residents didn't understand the advice. If the messages were shorter and in plain language, more people would follow them.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "4b25334a3d5248d1b2802d076ec73f3b543bcb5f120e51a84b51ce20eda2760b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1494,
        "sourceEnd": 1636,
        "text": "Sorry, can I correct something? I said earlier the alerts were late, but I checked again. They were on time. The problem was only the wording.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "d495a51a6e4e015c9d0d698a675692b042e2e248752466eba0ddff9488c4e8bb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1643,
        "sourceEnd": 1911,
        "text": "Thanks for the correction, Tom. That's important. So, to summarize: the river model needs better rainfall data; the air-quality network needs one more sensor near the industrial park; and the heat alerts need simpler language. Priya, can you draft the recommendations?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "7329bab954972363700e058fd74c4d1935e3934021a4d572df8ee73a13f1366a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 1919,
        "sourceEnd": 2025,
        "text": "Sure. I'll send a draft by Friday. If everyone sends me their notes by Wednesday, I can finish it on time.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "7f7411954f4d24a4ff041f5bc9aff8ebe198a32d2234090c56147aca147959f7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 2034,
        "sourceEnd": 2058,
        "text": "I'll send mine tomorrow.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "8a3ff67c23fd7d6599efd6096a29a33cf47e0493c3d00dfb74e9318e66f2470e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "elena",
        "speaker": "Elena",
        "sourceStart": 2066,
        "sourceEnd": 2073,
        "text": "Me too.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "762c20b866b7b2635d6a80b622b0bea2826ce4a81897140c250f0fb2bbbd2ee7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2080,
        "sourceEnd": 2154,
        "text": "Great. Let's meet again next Monday to review the draft. Thanks, everyone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "09131215b1bc1f188dd2f76eb03874e88b88a700a999384f6d64e6b38f58ae11",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
